depends: MDV-P8-009, MDV-P8-011, MDV-P8-012, MDV-P8-014, MDV-P8-019
confidence: 50 | Needs a pilot dentist.
sources: Dentist review of the clinic journey (whiteboard, 15 Nov 2026)
desc:
Add a dental journey (first visit: register, history check, tooth chart, treatment plan and estimate, consent, procedure, invoice, next-stage booking, recall) to the journeys and run it as a Playwright spec on the real stack; a pilot dentist walks it and signs off.
ac:
- The dental journey passes on the real stack in English and Arabic, axe clean.
- A named dentist signs off, recorded in the session handoff.
notes:
- Source: DentalERP (github.com/abinauv/dental-erp, MIT; reference reviewed 17 Nov 2026).
- Reference: DentalERP Playwright specs under tests/ show a dental journey; Medvya runs its own on the real stack.
